  - tName: 2
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: A beautiful, wondrous world inhabited by monstrous creatures ready
        to tear you apart... Just what we need!
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bc3e05adbb39fa4c89ea706d364d97b, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: First, select a mission, at the beginning of the campaign there is
        only one mission
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d33ce7d52d44aaf489aed69bd23bc056, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: But, first, let's look at the magnificent ammunition that the great
        master of blacksmithing, Borion, forged for us!
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1542870246}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: But, first, let's look at the magnificent ammunition that the great
        master of blacksmithing, Borion, forged for us!
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1564627199}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: The journey to the mission will take a few minutes, but you can run
        to speed things up
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7cd01f29953d6a444a7553d6fdd79558, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 4214988657985799855}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Running will take some energy, but it will be restored over time.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c4a86ece493f9d458ae940a58816660, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 4905371698984710295}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: "We\u2019ll hardly kill anyone with this, but at least will ruin their
        health. Let's take a look at the armor."
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1848753345}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Here we are, time to get started! Take out your sword, if one can
        call it that...
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea5626b260295574bb04036e0d4e46bf, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 4214988657985799855}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: "We\u2019ll hardly kill anyone with this, but at least will ruin their
        health. Let's take a look at the armor."
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1967507534}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 3
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: Each monster has a speed characteristic. The higher the speed, the
        less times you can hit before he attacks you.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a7002c4336b6ea2479e0fa9b75115729, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: When the speed bar is full, the monster attacks.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5db5d5592b32e174bbd5f599dd912169, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Let's try to defeat him before he defeats us. Tap on the monster!
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fede5e5352703154789871676da360e1, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1542870246}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: But, first, let's look at the magnificent ammunition that the great
        master of blacksmithing, Borion, forged for us!
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 949524581}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 4
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: We did it and received a well-deserved reward, although your health
        is no longer the same...
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8fee8e8c4c1114444a0cefa212612ee5, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: Let's try to defeat him before he defeats us. Tap on the monster!
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 237856124}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: After completing the main mission, we can move on to one of the next
        ones.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b937903cfee01104c8f9b89c595a52ea, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: "The main mission is more difficult than the previous one, but without
        completing it, we will not know what\u2019s next"
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a22e62ea24194564d8b30571560bea7d, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 949524581}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: But remember, once you complete the campaign, you will have to start
        it from the beginning next time.
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 982524977}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: However, there are other daily missions, they are easier, but give
        a good reward.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ace050c2bd23bd4cb334a766e3fb8c0, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 949524581}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: But remember, once you complete the campaign, you will have to start
        it from the beginning next time.
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 941144296}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: You can either continue the campaign or complete it to replenish your
        health and improve your ammunition.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e345f0128387e9498002ea1f267400a, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 949524581}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: With your health and ammunition, we're unlikely to go far. Let's return
        and consider what we can do about this.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4448bf5e0c3f31548b31a13eebe127ca, type: 3}
