      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: We can finally summon the Moon Spirit! How lucky we have extra moon
        stones
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 6220153645028996707}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Each Moon Spirit has its own characteristics.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd726d7b46ceafd48a5905e12d98ac7b, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: 'These are: damage, attack speed, number of hits, amount of energy
        for one hit, and energy reserve'
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51d4458b3cc0c1147abcbbbde5eac330, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 2026612709}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: In addition, there are places to equip a sword, armor and amulet
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5534b92cea7940d4a99240712b47885d, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: In addition, there are places to equip a sword, armor and amulet
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 701118732}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: The sword increases the damage of the Spirit, but the amount of energy
        required to strike increases too
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59ff1000db33fe543881dad0e35a50ae, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Armor is needed to reduce energy costs per strike.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85eae91a3b6b4e44799a6a882c74a8ba, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: And in order to increase the  soul energy reserve, you need to equip
        the amulet.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eba4185e755139441814352b391c7c33, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Moon spirits can become stronger by devour the power of other spirits
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c888dcac3fd191546b13646c0e2b6b52, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: To become stronger, the Moon Spirit needs to devour Spirits of equal
        level to it in an amount equal to the current level of the Spirit
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57421a0fbff6dc34a922f52f994c9244, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Summon another Moon Spirit to strengthen the one you already have.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 730ca61c08b01ed47bde85232f3f673f, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 7898888132347266025}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1313998771}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 6276978704670341957}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 383301618}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 1758470511}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 2104602758}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 387329370}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: Now let's attach this spirit to our amulet
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49a4be93cd43f6b4baf523f9d8a848dc, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 625332261}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 5482409452619844978}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 1
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: I think it's time to test the incredible power of the Moon Spirits
        in battle
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46f052d66946f95418197c21eae13962, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 14
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: Look, you have a Moon Spirit icon in battle.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b632681d17f52b47a7540fe1553f113, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 0
      message: 
      replica: {fileID: 0}
      lookObject: {fileID: 616203416}
      hole: 1
      isCustomHole: 1
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: When his speed bar is full, by clicking on the icon, you can make
        an attack
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c2ebb22a55b8604eb6b204568482209, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: The speed bar fills up every time you hit a monster. The higher the
        Moon Spirit's speed, the faster its speed bar fills
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8197c4e06d7451647bf4e34590f1fd63, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 15
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: You are growing before our eyes, and have already raised your level!
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b72960897b58c7d428720f51259bbe20, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: For every monster you kill you gain experience. When the experience
        bar is full, you will receive an ability point.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6c25829b258058b4e9de6cc412554a0c, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: At the end of the campaign, in the hero's menu, you can spend the
        points to increase the level of your abilities
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe1c4ce9443cce94a97824df4198d709, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 16
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: Congratulations! You have opened a new campaign, full of new adventures
        and valuable rewards!
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 94613557bfd52ea46857be2be04922be, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 497831852}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
            m_MethodName: SetActive
            m_Mode: 6
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: 
              m_BoolArgument: 1
            m_CallState: 2
    - mascot: 1
      message: After completing the campaign, you will be able to move on to a new
        chapter
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f019c1f7caa15e542a827ee04289fd4f, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - mascot: 1
      message: In addition, you can test your strength in the new Power Test mode
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0fe7aba73e0a55c4e9b377e264319017, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 17
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: You've defeated the boss and completed the first campaign! Now the
        time and energy required to complete this campaign will be significantly
        reduced!
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c7c8a647eb4ea4a4b8673cc379d2ccef, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - tName: 18
    data:
    - mascot: 1
      message: This is a potion that you can use before the fight. But to do this,
        buy a travel bag and put your bottles in it.
      replica: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6633c34b1260adc4499f24217ed6120d, type: 3}
      lookObject: {fileID: 0}
      hole: 0
      isCustomHole: 0
      finger: 0
      triggerEvent:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
